  description: '3 Level 8 monsters

    The first time this card would be destroyed
    by battle or card effect each turn, it is not destroyed. You can only use each
    of the following effects of "DoomZ XII End - Drastrius" once per turn. If this
    card is Xyz Summoned: You can equip 1 other face-up monster on the field to this
    card as an Equip Spell. When your opponent activates a monster effect on the
    field or GY (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card; negate
    that effect, then you can equip 1 face-up monster your opponent controls to this
    card as an Equip Spell.'
